# Line ending normalization — IMPORTANT for WSL2 environments
# After modifying this file, always run: git add --renormalize .
# Without renormalization, git rewrites files during checkout to convert
# line endings, which can corrupt WSL2 inodes (symptoms: ??????? permissions,
# ENOENT on files that exist). See session log 2026-02-08_20-35-05 for details.
#
# Normalize line endings to LF on commit
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly declare text files
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

# Binary files (don't modify)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.parquet binary
